      "text": "[5:46AM] #Apapa\n#TrafficUpdate \n\nWe have a high influx of Tankers on Marine bridge from  Sifax intersection navigating inward Dockyard  to connect their various deports.\n\nSubsequently vehicles coming from both Sifax and Ijora high bridge should exercise  caution as they approach the intersection inward Total up bridge. Our Officers are strategically positioned  to ensure free flow of traffic along the corridor.\n#FollowLASTMA",
