      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1976888749985267773",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1976888749985267773",
      "text": "[6:40AM] #Ikorodu\n#Ogolonto\n #TrafficUpdate\nGood movement from Aruna inward Agric and also a good one approaching Aunty Kenny at this moment of the day. \n\nMoving towards Idiroko, Ogolonto, Majidun down to Itowolo has nothing to fear about traffic wise.\n The return journey is also in a very good shape. \n\nIta elewa axis is cool and calm for those coming through Ireshe road connecting Ojogbe, General Hospital down to Ebute police post.\n\nIgbogbo and its environs are calm.\n Ebute axis is experiencing a better movement from all sides.\n Oba sekunmade is appreciable down to Ogolonto intersection.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
      "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
      "retweetCount": 4,
